      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How much does it cost to transport a bike from Mumbai to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost typically ranges between INR 1,200 and INR 2,500 depending on the bike’s size, the level of packaging you choose, and any additional services like insurance or expedited delivery. Our instant rate calculator provides an exact figure after you enter the bike model and preferred service tier.</p>
