      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the usual transit time for a bike parcel from Mumbai to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, a bike shipped via our dedicated hydraulic‑ramp container trucks reaches Pune within 4‑6 hours. This includes door‑to‑door pickup, secure loading, expressway transit on NH 48, and final doorstep delivery, ensuring a swift and reliable move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a zero‑scratch guarantee for two‑wheelers on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers offers a zero‑scratch guarantee backed by a full inspection before pickup and after delivery. If any damage is recorded, we handle the claim promptly, covering repair costs through our IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do I need any special documents to ship my bike from Mumbai to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a GST invoice (if applicable), and an e‑Way bill for interstate transport. Our team prepares all paperwork and can submit the documents to corporate or government reimbursement portals on your behalf.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike’s journey in real time?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every container truck is equipped with satellite GPS that streams live location data to our customer portal. You receive a tracking link at pickup, allowing you to monitor the bike’s progress along the NH 19, NH 27, and NH 48 corridors until doorstep delivery.</p>
